2154 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Redesigned the B2B e\055commerce journey for EE during migration to a custom CMS\054 with a focus on improving mobile conversion\056\nLed with quantitative and behavioural research\072 analytics revealed 68\0565\045 mobile traffic but significantly lower mobile conversion\056 Funnel analysis and session insights identified friction in plan comparison\054 hidden filtering\054 and high cognitive load on mobile\056\nRan stakeholder design sprints to align on measurable hypotheses\054 then prototyped and A\057B tested interaction patterns\056 Replacing dropdown filters with visible \034chip\035 filters delivered a 159\045 uplift in engagement\054 contributing to conversion growth from 5\0562\045 to 6\05675\045 post\055launch\056\nImpact\072 Research\055driven UX decisions directly improved mobile usability and measurable business performance\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 2155 0 R
     /Pg 2145 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

