2158 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Collaborated within a multidisciplinary team to redesign The Hub\054 an account management platform for EE business customers\054 addressing usability and trust issues in the legacy \034Business Zone\056\035\nResearch\072 Co\055facilitated and moderated in\055depth user interviews \050limited but high\055value sample\051\054 guiding participants through live demonstrations of the existing platform and proposed designs\056 Analysed rich qualitative data to surface users\031 mental models\054 emotional responses\054 and the impact of recurring bugs and performance issues on confidence and task completion\056\nTriangulated findings with competitor analysis and analytics on high\055traffic pages and funnel drop\055offs to pinpoint frustrations and friction points\056\nOutcome\072 Users responded positively to proposed designs during moderated sessions\054 validating structural UX improvements\056 Research insights informed prioritisation across UX and engineering\054 ensuring usability enhancements addressed both interaction design and system performance concerns\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 2159 0 R
     /Pg 2145 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

