  << /ActualText (Discovery\072 Led user interviews with football scouts and conducted competitor analysis to understand evaluation workflows\054 pain points\054 and opportunities\056 Partnered with senior stakeholders \050CEO\054 Sporting Director\051 to align on product vision and priorities\056\nDefinition\072 Defined a mobile\055first MVP strategy under tight time and engineering constraints\054 establishing a clear North Star while prioritising core scouting workflows\056 Translated ambiguous requirements into a focused\054 actionable product scope\056\nSolution\072 Delivered a simplified player evaluation experience optimised for speed and usability in live and post\055match contexts\056 Introduced a flexible grading system to accommodate varying mental models\054 validated through user testing and iterative feedback\056 Drove delivery by managing scope and maintaining engineering focus\056\nOutcome\072 Successfully launched v1\054 enabling a more structured and consistent scouting workflow\056 Reduced reliance on fragmented tools and established a foundation for future enhancements\054 including improved data visibility and video\055integrated reporting\056)
